so: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230725184058&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/A_Wandering_Soul_27daa1.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see A Wandering Soul.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Ooooh... the sadness...</li><li>Leave me alone in my mourning...</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>North-western <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>He is grieving the loss of a beloved one.<br/>\nHe will help you enchant your <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Crystal\">Blood Crystal</a> in the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for A Wandering Soul.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nA Wandering Soul: Is that you...? No... it's not... she never woke up again... the pain... cursed... to wander... Leave me alone in my mourning...<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">A Wandering Soul</strong></span>\n</p><p>Once you start mission 5 of the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>:\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nA Wandering Soul: I saw you... who are you... what do you want from me...?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nA Wandering Soul: No... I don't think I can help you... leave me alone in my mourning...<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">A Wandering Soul</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["blood-brothers-quest"],"pos":{"x":32915,"y":31490,"z":7}}